+| AC-005 | Failed additional payment | Decline or incomplete authentication leaves the new store pending and preserves existing-store access and correct existing billing state. A pending store grants no access and exposes no data. | D-01 | Actual sandbox failure plus API/DB/UI checks |
+| AC-006 | Idempotent retry | Double submit, retry with a new key, network timeout, duplicate/out-of-order delivery and concurrent retry resolve to one intended operation, one account customer and one charge without duplicate stores. A retry with a new key and a network timeout reconcile to one operation, one customer and one payment session. No operation is closed as unpaid without proof from the provider. | D-01 | Controlled fault/concurrency tests plus owned event receipts |
