+- Files: `SOURCE_REGISTER.md`; `GOVERNING/`; `QAM/QAM_RISK_REQUIREMENTS.md`; `QAM/QAM_PREFLIGHT.md`; `QAM/QAM_ENTRY.md`; `QAM/HANDOFFS/ENGINEERING_HANDOFF.md`.
